WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.770
DARIUS RUCKER.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:08.541
[cheers and applause]

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:09.743
[whistling]

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.583
- [playing guitar]

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:20.053
♪ DON'T GO OUT
WITH MY FRIENDS NO MORE ♪

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.554
♪ DON'T WANNA
HOLD YOUR HAND NO MORE ♪

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:24.323
- HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:26.192
[crowd chanting]
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:28.094
- ♪ AND I DON'T WANNA
BE WITH YOU ♪

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.563
all: HOOTIE, HOOTIE,
HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.331
- NO, NO.
all: HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:34.367
- NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.070
I'M NOT IN HOOTIE
AND THE BLOWFISH ANYMORE, Y'ALL.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.238
DOING MY OWN THING.

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:42.642
- WHAT DO YOU MEAN "IN HOOTIE"?
BECAUSE YOU ARE HOOTIE, MAN!

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.211
COME ON, EVERYBODY!
all: HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:47.413
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE...
- NO, NO...

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:51.217
NO, NO, NO, ALL RIGHT,
NOW--NOW--NOW STOP IT, STOP IT.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.720
I'M NOT HOOTIE.
I'M DARIUS RUCKER. ALL RIGHT?

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:56.689
I USED TO BE THE FRONT MAN

00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:58.691
FOR A BAND CALLED
HOOTIE AND THE BLOWFISH.

00:00:58.724 --> 00:00:59.826
ALL RIGHT,
BUT I WAS NEVER HOOTIE.

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:02.228
THERE WAS NEVER A HOOTIE.

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:03.830
- WAIT,

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.698
JUST--IF I MAY--
IF I MAY ASK,

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:07.500
WHERE ARE THE BLOWFISH AT,
RIGHT, GUYS?

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.469
COME ON, EVERYBODY!
BLOWFISH!

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:10.636
all: [chanting]
BLOWFISH, BLOWFISH, BLOWFISH...

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:12.705
- NO, NO, NO! THE--

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:15.608
THERE ARE NO PEOPLE KNOWN
AS "THE BLOWFISH," Y'ALL.

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.710
OKAY?

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.113
THE WHOLE BAND WAS JUST CALLED
HOOTIE AND THE BLOWFISH.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.381
THAT'S IT.
IT WAS A NONSENSE NAME.

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:25.151
LIKE HOOBASTANK.
OR TOAD THE WET SPROCKET.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:25.718
- OH.

00:01:30.856 --> 00:01:33.759
- [plays guitar]

00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:35.695
♪ DON'T GO OUT
WITH MY FRIENDS NO MORE ♪

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:39.499
♪ DON'T WANNA
HOLD YOUR HAND NO MORE ♪

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:40.733
- OH! OH!

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:42.568
- WHAT? WHAT IS IT, MAN?

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.303
- I SEE. I GET IT NOW.
I UNDERSTAND.

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.305
HEY, WE GOTTA PICK, Y'ALL!

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:48.207
WE GOTTA CHOOSE BETWEEN...
- NO, NO...

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.343
HOOTIE OR THE BLOWFISH!

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:53.279
SO, WHO WANTS TO SEE
THE BLOWFISH?

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.882
[crowd cheers]

00:01:55.915 --> 00:02:00.353
- THERE'S NO BLOWFISH.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:01.821
- AND WHO WANTS
TO SEE HOOTIE?

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:09.228
- HEY.

00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:11.364
HEY, THAT--THAT HURTS
MY FEELINGS, Y'ALL.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.665
- YEAH, BUT YOU SAID
YOU WEREN'T HOOTIE.

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:14.700
- NO, I'M NOT, SIR.

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:17.170
BUT IN THE QUESTION
YOU JUST ASKED THE AUDIENCE,

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.871
I-I WAS CLEARLY HOOTIE.

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:20.406
- SO YOU ARE HOOTIE!
- I'M NOT, THOUGH.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.508
- HE IS HOOTIE!

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:23.676
- NO...
[crowd cheers]

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.912
- HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.948
all: [chanting]
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE,

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:31.517
HOOTIE, HOOTIE,

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:35.555
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE,

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:39.792
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE...
[crowd cheering]

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:43.963
HOOTIE, HOOTIE, HOOTIE...

00:02:43.996 --> 00:02:47.533
- [sobbing]
I'M HOOTIE!

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:48.632
I'M HOOTIE! AAH!

